    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akeshise shiobumaliilishi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio Mikaeli alabuukha, omukhulundu oyo omukhongo ousinjilila abandubo; mana shilabaho eshise shiamasila; kata akafwana kario shikalikhwoho ta, okhurula olwa amahanga kachaaka okhubaho okhuula khushise eshio; ne khushise eshio abandubo balahonibwa, buli mundu oulanyoolekha niyahandiikwa mushitabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanji khubeenabo abakona mulufu lweliloba balasisimukha, abandi khubulamu oburahwaho ta, nabandi khutsisoni nokhufwolwa okhurakhwaho ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abali abachesi balaakha shinga okhwakha khwobwiyangu obwihaanyu; kata abo abashiukhasia abanji khubulunjishi, balaakha shinga tsinyininyini, obushia nobushia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa iwe, Danieli, yikala amakhuwa kano noboha eshitabu, okhuula khushise shiobumaliilishi; abanji baleelukhanga eyi nende eyi, obumanyi nibumeetekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana isie Danieli ndahenga, ne mbabo, abandu babili nibasinjiile, oundi khundulo womwalo injelekha yino noundi khandi khundulo womwalo injelekha yilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala nasunjila omundu tsana owali niyeefwalile tsingubo tsieikitani, owali emukulukhwo hamatsi komwalo, ari Tsilaba tsindaalo tsinga okhuula khubumaliilishi bwakamakana kano? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbulila omundu tsana owali niyeefwalile tsingubo tsieikitani, owali emukulukhwo hamatsi komwalo, nachinguula omukhonokwe musaatsa nomukhonokwe mukhasi khwikulu, niyeetsuba khu oyo oubeetsangaho mwoyo ebisoni nebisoni, mbu kakhabaho eshise, nebise bibili, neinusu yeshise; khandi mbu olwa balaba nibamalile okhutubula obunyali bwabandu abatakatifu, ako kosi kalahl nikahweele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbulila, ne shindatiila khushisina ta; mana nireeba mbu E omwami, akalarula mumakhuwa kano kalaba karie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nasunga mbu Tsia butsia, Danieli; okhuba amakhuwa kano keekaalwe nikabohwa okhuula khushise shiobumaliilishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanji balasiiywa nibalabibwa nibateemwa; ne ababii balakholanga obubii; kata abulaho khubabii oulatiila khushisina; ne abachesi nibo abalatiila khushisina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhurula khushise olwa omusango omusambe kwakhatsotso kularusibwaho, eshisinyo tsana eshionooninjia nishisinjisibwa, tsilaba tsindaalo eshikhumila ebikhumi bibili namakhumi shienda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noweikhabi oulindiilila, niyoola khundaalo etsio eshikhumila ebikhumi bitaru amakhumi kataru natsiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa iwe, tsia butsia, okhuula olwa obumaliilishi buliula; okhuba olahuluukha, ne olabuushila khumukabokwo khubumaliilishi bwetsindaalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
